[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `assert`, no null check, no range check, no error enum, and no named min/max
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m constant. It cannot report failure to its caller.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
