[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    66[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 21 | `premultiply` | — ; `rgb=0`, random `a`, `w=32,h=2` (rgb stays 0, alpha untouched) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    67[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 22 | `premultiply` | — ; **repeated application**: call `premultiply` twice on the same buffer, `w=16,h=16` seeded random — compares the composed pipeline, not one call | [x] |
